The command was killed, and `results/done.txt` was not created (the `results/` directory doesn't exist at all).

- **What happened:** `./run_hog.sh` ran `./hog.py`, which was terminated with SIGKILL (`line 3: 11603 Killed ./hog.py`, exit code 137).
